  "parentsMessageTitle": "Message for Parents",
  "parentsMessage": "Try to raise your children according to the Sunnah of the Prophet ﷺ and set the best example for them by living according to the Sunnah yourself.\n\nKeep children away from unnecessary mobile usage, mobile games, and futile activities as much as possible, so that their precious time is spent on the recitation of the Holy Quran, lesson preparation, and useful activities.\n\nMemorization of the Holy Quran is a great blessing and a big responsibility — do not treat it as an ordinary task. The cooperation of family members in the preparation of lessons, daily revision, and following the teacher's instructions is very important.\n\nTeach your child the habit of preparing lessons on time, doing daily revision, and following the teacher's instructions.\n\nWith love, encouragement, prayer, and continuous attention, accompany your child in their journey of Quran memorization.",

