  "aboutUs": "About Us",
  "aboutUsContent": "Huffaz Tracker is designed to make the daily management and tracking of Quran memorization students simple, organized, and effective.\n\nThe app helps teachers maintain records of students' Sabaq, Sabqi, Manzil, attendance, and daily performance. Monthly reports make it easy for parents to understand their child's progress, revision, and overall performance in Hifz.\n\nOur goal is to use modern technology to simplify the important task of monitoring Quran memorization, helping teachers manage records efficiently while keeping parents informed about their children's progress.",
